records of one JSON file. The roster check now compares each agent file with the agent template's
required sections, and four agents differ from that list on purpose. Each difference is recorded
with its reason so the check passes and the reason stays visible.

File (exactly one, it has no twin; ignore the twin instructions in RUN CONTEXT):
1. .skilled/agents/agent-registry.json

In the `agents` array, add a `templateExceptions` field as the LAST field of these four records
(directly after the record's `summary` field). Keep the file's two-space indentation, key order
and trailing newline. Change no other record and no other field.

Record `code`:
